Subject: [PATCH 2/2] SystemUI: expanded music controls for the island chip

Tapping the music chip opens a card with title, subtitle, a seek bar with
elapsed/total time, and previous, play/pause and next buttons. The card
re-reads the session every 500 ms and dismisses when the session ends.
Built in code and not compiled yet.

